            "description": "# pysmx\n\n**pysmx** is a Python package for parsing, executing, and simulating the environment of SourceMod plug-ins.\n\n\n## Quickstart\n\n```python\nfrom smx.compile import compile\nplugin = compile('''\n    public TwoPlusTwo() {\n        return 2 + 2;\n    }\n''')\nprint plugin.runtime.call_function_by_name('TwoPlusTwo')\n```\n",
